<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 69.9538 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 69.9538 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 69.9538 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.9859 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 9		   Oct 8</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.9538		 69.9859</p>
<p> volume ($ mln)		  1.620		   2.000</p>
<p>				    Oct9		    Oct 7</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46.0000		 45.8800</p>
<p> volume (DM mln)		 0.010		   0.020</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
